<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech RPIX closes up led by Komercni.</title>
<headline>Czech RPIX closes up led by Komercni.</headline>
<text>
<p>1200 GMT - Czech RPIX index closes up on Monday led by most major issues, especially Komercni Banka.</p>
<p>*  .RPIX risesa 8.8 points, 0.87 percent, to 1,019.4.</p>
<p>* Turnover, 28.3 million crowns.</p>
<p>* Komercni rises 57 crowns to 1,929.</p>
<p>* SPT Telecom gains 26 crowns to 3,025.</p>
<p>* CEZ up nine crowns to 910.</p>
<p>-- Robin Shepherd, Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
